  "name": "Signal Heights",
  "description": "Late Act 1, E12 Wrong Address and E13 Signal. A cold, high plateau far to the north, under snow. On the pinnacle in the north-west (`carrier-trace`) a radar or relay can trace the Biosphere Report's carrier: it isn't aimed at Sol but into the system. An old listening post in our own build style stands in the south-east (`listening-post`), where Act 1 ends with a radio voice from another planet. Skimmerwings nest in the crags. Suggested hooks: E12 as a site trigger at `carrier-trace` with radar or relay built, E13 at `listening-post` once Act 1's conditions are met.",
